==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has soared to a cool 87 MILLION downloads worldwide, and it's time to celebrate!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between December 18th (11:00am) and January 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Monthly Awakened Stages Appear!'''}}<br>
All previously available Monthly Awakened Stages will appear again in this special event!<br>
Get the True Forms of the limited Cats you collected from Monthly Event Stages at the set times below!

{{Color|#4285F4|'''・January, February, March & April Stages'''}}<br>
December 18th (11:00am) - December 23rd (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#4285F4|'''・May, June, July & August Stages'''}}<br>
December 23rd (11:00am) - December 28th (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#4285F4|'''・September, October, November & December Stages'''}}<br>
December 28th (11:00am) - January 1st (10:59am)

※ Monthly Awakened Stages are available after Empire of Cats Ch. 2 is cleared.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

